            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Testes autom\u00e1ticos:</strong><br />\n Coordenadas inv\u00e1lidas rejeitadas.<br />\n Valores inv\u00e1lidos rejeitados.<br />\n Sudoku n=3 (9x9): linhas, colunas, blocos e pistas v\u00e1lidos.<br />\n Sudoku n=2 (4x4): linhas, colunas, blocos e pistas v\u00e1lidos.</span>\n<h2 id=\"grellha-9x9-resolvida\">Grellha 9x9 resolvida</h2>\n<div class=\"language-text codehilite\"><pre><span></span><code>[6, 1, 8, 4, 9, 5, 2, 7, 3]\n[7, 5, 4, 2, 6, 3, 1, 8, 9]\n[3, 2, 9, 8, 1, 7, 5, 4, 6]\n[1, 6, 2, 5, 4, 8, 9, 3, 7]\n[4, 7, 3, 1, 2, 9, 8, 6, 5]\n[8, 9, 5, 3, 7, 6, 4, 1, 2]\n[5, 4, 1, 7, 3, 2, 6, 9, 8]\n[2, 3, 6, 9, 8, 1, 7, 5, 4]\n[9, 8, 7, 6, 5, 4, 3, 2, 1]\n</code></pre></div></span>"
